<title>FRANCE: French court takes up claim in Hernu spy charges.</title>
<headline>French court takes up claim in Hernu spy charges.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A French court agreed on Wednesday to consider a claim for damages by the sons of the late Socialist defence minister Charles Hernu against the weekly L'Express which accused him of spying for the communist bloc.</p>
</text>
